    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Models Dropped From Labels",
      "description": "CARDINALITY GUARD. Every spanmetrics `dimension` multiplies the Prometheus series count, and model ids are the one unbounded dimension. The gateway admits the first FROSTY_OTEL_MODEL_CARDINALITY_CAP distinct models (default 11) as `frosty.metrics.model` and folds every further one to \"other\".\n\nA non-zero value here means label detail is being dropped: metrics for the folded models are merged into the \"other\" series. NOTHING IS LOST FROM TRACES - the span in Tempo still carries the real gen_ai.request.model, so drill-down is unaffected.\n\nTo restore per-model breakdown, raise FROSTY_OTEL_MODEL_CARDINALITY_CAP and accept the extra series, or leave it and use Tempo for the long tail.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
